[CHOSEN, not recovered] vkd3d-shader 2.1 patch for the BF2 macOS port (LGPL-2.1+, as vkd3d).
Loop unrolling is bounded by array indexing when the exit depends on a uniform, as d3dcompiler
does: xpack RaShaderSTM_Shadows.hlsl for (q < ShadowCount) Out.ShadowTexCoord[q] = ... unrolls to
ShadowTexCoord's 6 elements (D3DX9_25's vs_1_1 output has no flow control) instead of failing at
the implicit 1024-iteration limit. The first out-of-bounds iteration is recorded and the unroll is
retried with that count as an explicit limit (SM3 targets only).

